            "caption": "You can't out-diet it."
          }
        },
        "slide_2": {
          "type": "media_slide",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/screenshot-2026-07-16-at-10-53-24-am-2-concept-14-out-train-full-bleed-slide-final-design-125732196.png",
            "caption": "You can't out-train it."
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "slide_1",
        "slide_2"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "question_heading": "So why do we keep getting this <em>wrong?</em>",
        "question_body": "Because it's the biggest blind spot in human health. It's not something that happens to other people.",
        "eyebrow_text": "THE PROBLEM",
        "chart_heading": "Nitric Oxide production declines with age, beginning in your 20s.",
        "annotation_1": "Production begins declining in your mid-twenties",
        "annotation_2": "Poor diet and lack of exercise accelerate the drop",
        "annotation_3": "By age 40, you produce 50% or less of what you did at 20",
        "stat_value": "50%",
        "stat_label": "of nitric oxide by the average 40-year-old"
      }
    },
    "story_miracle_molecule": {
      "type": "story-miracle-molecule",
      "blocks": {
        "pair_1": {
          "type": "stage3_pair",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/screenshot-2026-06-30-at-7-26-06-am-1-page-overview-for-client-section-108343967.png",
            "text": "Dr. Ferid Murad discovered that nitric oxide signals blood vessels to dilate."
          }
        },
        "pair_2": {
          "type": "stage3_pair",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/screenshot-2026-06-30-at-7-27-08-am-1-page-overview-for-client-section-108344005.png",
            "text": "When Nitric Oxide is present, vessels open. Blood flows."
          }
        },
        "pair_3": {
          "type": "stage3_pair",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/screenshot-2026-06-30-at-7-33-26-am-1-page-overview-for-client-section-108344006.png",
            "text": "When it's missing, they constrict. Pressure rises. Damage follows."
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "pair_1",
        "pair_2",
        "pair_3"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow_text": "THE MIRACLE MOLECULE",
        "video_poster": "shopify://shop_images/screenshot-2026-07-15-at-2-45-00-pm-1-concept-14-red-particle-molecule-visual-1-final-art-direction-12601662.png",
        "stage1_text_1": "And at the center of it all is one thing you were never taught to think about: <strong>Nitric oxide.</strong>",
        "stage1_text_2": "They call it the miracle molecule. But scientists don't call it that lightly.",
        "stage2_no_headline": "NO",
        "stage2_subheadline": "the most important molecule in your cardiovascular system",
        "closing_text": "– keeping those <strong>60,000 miles</strong> open, flowing… and <strong>alive.</strong>",
        "scroll_distance": 10
      }
    },
    "story_origin": {
      "type": "story-origin",
      "settings": {
        "eyebrow_text": "ORIGIN",
        "founding_heading_1": "In 1998, the discovery of what nitric oxide does for the human body won the Nobel Prize in Medicine.",
        "founding_body_1": "We didn’t discover it. But we did have the nerve to take the Nobel-winning science out of the lab — and bring it to the people who needed it. That’s where the revolution started.",
        "founding_heading_2": "In 2009, that same discovery led to a nitric oxide research program at the University of Texas. And that’s where Humann came to life.",
        "founding_body_2": "Fifteen years later, the science hasn’t changed. Our commitment to it hasn’t either.",
        "archival_image_1": "shopify://shop_images/screenshot-2026-06-30-at-9-47-10-am-1-page-overview-for-client-section-108343522.png",
        "archival_image_2": "shopify://shop_images/screenshot-2026-07-01-at-7-47-34-am-1-page-overview-for-client-section-108343527.png",
